I've only had a year of Latin (only?), but to my knowledge it means 
(roughly) "to gold". If you search by it, there should be a secret door.
If you open the door (usually locked) there should be a trap on the other
side of the door.  The trap usually teleports you to the Magic Memory Vault,
but on lower levels it is often a trapdoor or level teleporter.

